{"seq":2,"slug":"disease-frequency","title":"疾病频率测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/disease-frequency","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"疾病频率测量\">疾病频率测量</h1><p>「最近发病多吗」这句日常问话，在流行病学里要拆成两个完全不同的问题：现在有多少人正患病，与一段时间里新冒出多少病例。前者是患病率，后者是发病率，二者常被混用却度量着不同的东西。把频率测准、把分母选对，是所有后续关联估计与因果判断的地基——分子分母一旦错位，再精巧的研究设计也会塌方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流行病学的频率指标可以按「分子是新发还是现患」「分母是人数还是人时」两个维度归类。一个干净的心智模型是把人群想象成一个浴缸：水位是现患病例数，水龙头流入是新发病例，下水道排出是康复或死亡。患病率关心水位，发病率关心水龙头的流速。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[频率测量] --&gt; B[发病指标&lt;br/&gt;分子=新发病例]&#10;    A --&gt; C[现患指标&lt;br/&gt;分子=现存病例]&#10;    B --&gt; D[累积发病率&lt;br/&gt;分母=期初人数]&#10;    B --&gt; E[发病密度&lt;br/&gt;分母=人时]&#10;    C --&gt; F[时点患病率&lt;br/&gt;某一刻]&#10;    C --&gt; G[期间患病率&lt;br/&gt;一段时间]&#10;    D -.随访完整.-&gt; H[风险解释]&#10;    E -.随访不齐.-&gt; I[速率解释]\">flowchart TD\n    A[频率测量] --&gt; B[发病指标&lt;br/&gt;分子=新发病例]\n    A --&gt; C[现患指标&lt;br/&gt;分子=现存病例]\n    B --&gt; D[累积发病率&lt;br/&gt;分母=期初人数]\n    B --&gt; E[发病密度&lt;br/&gt;分母=人时]\n    C --&gt; F[时点患病率&lt;br/&gt;某一刻]\n    C --&gt; G[期间患病率&lt;br/&gt;一段时间]\n    D -.随访完整.-&gt; H[风险解释]\n    E -.随访不齐.-&gt; I[速率解释]</pre><p>下表把核心频率指标的分子、分母、取值范围与解读列在一起，这张表后续在 <a href=\"../study-design/cohort-studies\">队列研究</a> 估计风险时会反复用到。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>取值范围</th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>累积发病率（风险）</td>\n<td>期内新发病例</td>\n<td>期初无病人数</td>\n<td>0–1</td>\n<td>个体在期内发病的概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发病密度（率）</td>\n<td>期内新发病例</td>\n<td>累积人时</td>\n<td>0–∞</td>\n<td>单位人时的发病速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时点患病率</td>\n<td>某时点现患</td>\n<td>该时点总人数</td>\n<td>0–1</td>\n<td>此刻患病的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期间患病率</td>\n<td>期内曾患（含期初）</td>\n<td>期间平均人数</td>\n<td>0–1</td>\n<td>一段时间内的患病比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"累积发病率与发病密度\">累积发病率与发病密度</h2><p>累积发病率（cumulative incidence，又称风险）是最直观的发病指标：在一个起点都无病的封闭人群里，随访固定时长，发病人数除以起点人数。某社区 1000 名健康成人随访五年，新发冠心病 50 例，五年累积发病率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CI = 50/1000 = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50/1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>，即 5%。它是一个概率，前提是随访基本完整、失访很少。</p>\n<p>现实里随访很难整齐：有人中途迁出、有人提前死于他因、有人晚入组。此时分母用「人数」会失真，应改用「人时」。发病密度（incidence density）的分母是每个人实际处于风险状态的时间之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>新发病例数</mtext><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ID = \\dfrac{\\text{新发病例数}}{\\sum_i t_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.346em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新发病例数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若上例中 1000 人因失访与死亡，累积贡献了 4500 人年，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4500</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ID = 50 / 4500 \\approx 0.0111</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50/4500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0111</span></span></span></span></span> 例/人年，即每 100 人年约 1.1 例。发病密度没有上界、单位是「每人时」，它度量的是瞬时发病速度而非概率。两者关系可近似为：当发病率低、时间短时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CI \\approx ID \\times t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。选哪个，取决于随访是否齐整——这一权衡在队列研究设计中是核心决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"患病率与三者关系\">患病率与三者关系</h2><p>患病率（prevalence）度量某一刻或某一段时间内现存病例占人群的比例。时点患病率回答「今天有多少人正患糖尿病」，期间患病率把一段时间内任何时刻患过病的人都算进分子。患病率不区分新旧病例，因此它同时受发病率和病程影响。三者有一个在低患病率下成立的经典近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx ID \\times \\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均病程。这个关系解释了一个反直觉现象：一种治疗如果只延长寿命却不治愈疾病（病程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变长），患病率会上升——患病率升高未必意味着发病情况恶化，也可能是病人活得更久。把患病率当发病率来读，是政策解读中的常见错误。患病率适合衡量疾病负担与卫生资源需求，发病率才适合衡量病因作用强度，这一区分在 <a href=\"../study-design/cross-sectional-ecological\">横断面与生态研究</a> 里关系到设计能回答什么问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"比-比例-率与标化\">比、比例、率与标化</h2><p>日常里「比例」「比」「率」常被混称，流行病学需要严格区分。比例（proportion）的分子是分母的一部分，取值 0–1，如患病率。比（ratio）的分子分母互不包含，如性别比（男/女）。率（rate）则带有时间维度，分母是人时。死亡率、出生率、罹患率各属其类，混淆会导致量纲错误。</p>\n<p>人群间比较频率时，年龄结构是最大的搅局者。一个老龄化城市的粗死亡率天然高于一个年轻城市，并不代表它医疗更差。标准化（standardization）就是为消除这种结构差异而生。直接标化用一个统一的标准人口的年龄构成，对各组的年龄别率加权平均，得到「假如两地年龄结构相同会是多少」。间接标化则在年龄别率不稳定时，用标准率算出期望病例数，得到标化死亡比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mtext>实际死亡数</mtext><mtext>期望死亡数</mtext></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SMR = \\dfrac{\\text{实际死亡数}}{\\text{期望死亡数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期望死亡数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际死亡数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。下面用一个微型例子说明直接标化的逻辑：A 地老人多、粗率高，标化后若与 B 地接近，说明差异主要来自年龄而非真实风险。比较任何粗率前先问「标化了吗」，是流行病学家的条件反射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率与关联的桥梁\">频率与关联的桥梁</h2><p>频率本身只描述「多少」，要回答病因问题必须把两组频率放在一起做差或做商，这就跨入了关联度量。两组发病率相除得到相对危险度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，相减得到归因危险度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>；病例对照研究里用比值比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。这些度量的定义、适用条件与解释，分别在 <a href=\"../study-design/cohort-studies\">队列研究</a> 和 <a href=\"../study-design/case-control\">病例对照研究</a> 中展开，此处只点明它们都建立在本章的频率指标之上。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，关联度量的合法性取决于频率测量的质量。如果分子的病例定义不一致、分母的人群界定模糊、失访没有用人时校正，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 算到小数点后三位也是空中楼阁。因果推断的链条上，频率测量是最底层、也最容易被忽视的一环——后续 <a href=\"../bias-effects/bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a> 讨论的测量偏倚，很多正是从这一层渗入的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>发病指标（累积发病率、发病密度）测「新发」，现患指标（患病率）测「现存」，三者经 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\approx ID \\times \\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相联。</li>\n<li>随访整齐用累积发病率（概率，0–1），随访不齐用发病密度（速率，分母为人时）。</li>\n<li>患病率同时受发病率与病程影响，升高未必代表病因恶化，适合衡量疾病负担而非病因强度。</li>\n<li>比、比例、率三者量纲不同不可混用；跨人群比较前必须做年龄标化（直接标化或 SMR）。</li>\n<li>频率是关联度量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）的地基，分子分母一旦错位，下游所有推断都会失真。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"疾病频率测量","id":"疾病频率测量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"累积发病率与发病密度","id":"累积发病率与发病密度"},{"level":2,"text":"患病率与三者关系","id":"患病率与三者关系"},{"level":2,"text":"比、比例、率与标化","id":"比-比例-率与标化"},{"level":2,"text":"频率与关联的桥梁","id":"频率与关联的桥梁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流行病学的定义与思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/definition-thinking"},"next":{"title":"因果推断框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/causal-inference"}}